  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the Return and Reintegration of Iraqis with Perceived Affiliation to Islamic State of Iraq and the Levant (ISIL) &#x2013; Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will contribute towards improved stability in Iraq and reduce the risk of renewed violence, by strengthening sub-national social cohesion, addressing localized drivers of violent extremism and enhancing community capacities to address challenges related to the return and reintegration of Iraqis with perceived affiliation to the Islamic State of the Levant (ISIL). This project adopts a whole-of-society approach towards the prevention of violent extremism (PVE) and falls within German Foreign Policy strategic priority areas related to combatting terrorism, crisis prevention, conflict resolution and peacebuilding.</narrative>
  </description>
